# An object refers to its ρ and to itself, via ξ.
#
#   ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ ρ ↦ ∅, b ↦ ξ.ρ.c, e ↦ ξ ⟧, c ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.a.e.b ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 a c foo
F c1 ρ b e
D c2 c1 ρ
D c3 c2 c
P c1 b c3
P c1 e c1
P c0 a c1
F c4
Δ c4 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
P c0 c c4
D c5 c0 a
D c6 c5 e
D c7 c6 b
P c0 foo c7
